# AMPL: AMPL: A Modeling Language for Mathematical Programming (Fourer, Gay, Kernighan), appendix A; requirements/languages/ampl.md
name     ampl
keyword  set param var maximize minimize subject to s.t. let solve display option data model in within
keyword  sum prod forall exists if then else union inter diff cross binary integer default
builtin  card max min abs Infinity
ident-part     .
line-comment   #
block-comment  /* */
string   " "  : doubled
string   ' '  : doubled
operators  +-*/^=<>:;,{}[]().
